  "goodToKnow": "Das Untergeschoss (UG) is a basement or lower floor, often in shops and car parks: im zweiten Untergeschoss. In German buildings, das Erdgeschoss (EG) is the ground floor, and der erste Stock or das erste Obergeschoss (1. OG) the floor above, a classic confusion for Americans. In houses, the basement is usually der Keller. Das Geschoss also means projectile. Plural: die Untergeschosse."
